expression: stdout
---
Enable high torque mode

Usage: wheelctl safety enable [OPTIONS] <DEVICE>

Arguments:
  <DEVICE>  Device ID or name

Options:
      --force                Skip safety confirmation
      --json                 Output in JSON format for machine parsing
  -v, --verbose...           Verbose logging
      --no-mock              Fail if wheeld is unreachable instead of showing simulated data [env: WHEELCTL_NO_MOCK=1]
      --endpoint <ENDPOINT>  Service endpoint (for testing) [env: WHEELCTL_ENDPOINT=]
  -h, --help                 Print help
